cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sbmlsim, please cite it as below."
title: "sbmlsim: SBML simulation made easy"
abstract: "sbmlsim is a collection of python utilities for the simulation of models in the Systems Biology Markup Language (SBML) built on libroadrunner: simulation experiments, parameter scans, parameter fitting, sensitivity analysis, SED-ML and COMBINE archives, and reports."
type: software
authors:
